  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India - Production of tempeh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a Start-up loan from the DGGF Community Food Systems and Services B.V. (CFSS) will be able to produce tempeh in India together with their local daughter.They will invest in machinery and tools, operational costs, buildings, transport and inventory. The estimated impact on local employment is the creation of approx. 52 local jobs and knowledge transfer to local soy farmers: production methods, good agricultural practices, amongst others.</narrative>
  </description>
